@model namanh.ViewModel.ListTripViewModel
@using PagedList.Mvc
@using namanh.ViewModel
@using namanh.Models
@using namanh.Utils
@using Helpers
@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Danh sách chuyến chạy";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_AdminLayout.cshtml";
}
<div class="page-header">
    <div class="page-title">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-align-right fa-rotate-180 fa-sm"></i>
        <span>Danh sách chuyến chạy</span>
    </div>
    <div class="header-elements">
        <a href="#" onclick="history.go(-1)" class="btn-main btn-labeled bg-brown ms-1">
            <span class="icon">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-left"></i>
            </span>
            Quay lại
        </a>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="content">
    @if (ViewBag.Result == "update")
    {
        <div id="AlertBox" class="alert alert-success"><strong>Cập nhật chuyến đi thành công</strong></div>
    }
    <div class="accordion">
        <div class="accordion-item border-left-slate">
            <div class="accordion-header">
                <div class="card-title">
                    <i class="fa-regular fa-magnifying-glass fa-lg"></i>
                    Tìm kiếm
                </div>
                <button type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#searchForm" aria-expanded="true">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-angle-down"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
            <div id="searchForm" class="accordion-collapse collapse show">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                    <form action="@Url.Action("ListTrip")" method="get" id="data-search-form">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-lg-3 mb-3">
                                <label class="mb-1">Mã KH:</label>
                                @Html.TextBoxFor(a => a.Code, new { @class = "form_control" })
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-3 mb-3">
                                <label class="mb-1">Số điện thoại:</label>
                                @Html.TextBoxFor(a => a.Mobile, new { @class = "form_control" })
                            </div>
                            @*<div class="col-lg-3 mb-3 search-customer">
                                    <label class="mb-1">Tên KH:</label>
                                    <select name="CustomerId" class="form_control select2">
                                        <option value="0">Tất cả KH</option>
                                        @foreach (var customer in Model.Customers)
                                        {
                                            <option value="@customer.Id" @if (Model.CustomerId == customer.Id) { @Html.Raw("selected") }>@customer.Name</option>
                                        }
                                    </select>
                                </div>*@
                            <div class="col-lg-3 mb-3 search-customer">
                                <label class="mb-1">Lái xe:</label>
                                <select name="DriverId" class="form_control select2">
                                    <option value="0">Tất cả</option>
                                    @foreach (var driver in Model.Drivers)
                                    {
                                        <option value="@driver.Id" @if (Model.DriverId == driver.Id) { @Html.Raw("selected") }>@driver.Name</option>
                                    }
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-3 mb-3">
                                <label class="mb-1">Trạng thái:</label>
                                <select class="form_control" name="Status">
                                    <option value="-1" @if (Model.Status == -1) { @Html.Raw("selected") }>Tất cả</option>
                                    <option value="0" @if (Model.Status == 0) { @Html.Raw("selected") }>Chốt</option>
                                    <option value="1" @if (Model.Status == 1) { @Html.Raw("selected") }>Cọc</option>
                                    <option value="2" @if (Model.Status == 2) { @Html.Raw("selected") }>Đang chạy</option>
                                    <option value="3" @if (Model.Status == 3) { @Html.Raw("selected") }>Hoàn thành</option>
                                    <option value="4" @if (Model.Status == 4) { @Html.Raw("selected") }>Công nợ</option>
                                    <option value="5" @if (Model.Status == 5) { @Html.Raw("selected") }>Hủy</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-3 mb-3">
                                <label class="mb-1">Thời gian:</label>
                                <select class="form_control" name="Time">
                                    <option value="all" @if (Model.Time == "all") { @Html.Raw("selected") }>Tất cả</option>
                                    <option value="today" @if (Model.Time == "today") { @Html.Raw("selected") }>Hôm nay</option>
                                    <option value="tomorrow" @if (Model.Time == "tomorrow") { @Html.Raw("selected") }>Ngày mai</option>
                                    <option value="week" @if (Model.Time == "week") { @Html.Raw("selected") }>Tuần này</option>
                                    <option value="nextweek" @if (Model.Time == "nextweek") { @Html.Raw("selected") }>Tuần sau</option>
                                    <option value="month" @if (Model.Time == "month") { @Html.Raw("selected") }>Tháng này</option>
                                    <option value="lastmonth" @if (Model.Time == "lastmonth") { @Html.Raw("selected") }>Tháng trước</option>
                                    <option value="year" @if (Model.Time == "year") { @Html.Raw("selected") }>Năm nay</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-3 mb-3">
                                <label class="mb-1">Ngày đi ngày về:</label>
                                @Html.EditorFor(a => a.dateRange)
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-3 mb-3">
                                <label class="mb-1">Loại xe:</label>
                                <select name="cars">
                                    <option>Loại xe</option>
                                    <option value="0" @if (Model.Cars == 0) { @Html.Raw("selected") }>4 chỗ</option>
                                    <option value="1" @if (Model.Cars == 1) { @Html.Raw("selected") }>7 chỗ</option>
                                    <option value="2" @if (Model.Cars == 2) { @Html.Raw("selected") }>16 chỗ</option>
                                    <option value="3" @if (Model.Cars == 3) { @Html.Raw("selected") }>29 chỗ</option>
                                    <option value="4" @if (Model.Cars == 4) { @Html.Raw("selected") }>35 chỗ</option>
                                    <option value="5" @if (Model.Cars == 5) { @Html.Raw("selected") }>45 chỗ</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="btn-group border-0 pt-0">
                            <button type="reset" onclick="resetAnyFormById('data-search-form');" class="btn-main btn-white" id="reset">
                                <span>Đặt lại</span>
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-right ms-2"></i>
                            </button>
                            <button type="submit" class="btn-main btn-primary text-white ms-3">
                                <span>Tìm kiếm</span>
                                <i class="fa-sharp fa-solid fa-paper-plane ms-2"></i>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="shadow p-3 rounded d-lg-none d-block bg-white mb-3">
            <span class="d-block">Tổng phí cầu đường: <strong class="text-danger">@Convert.ToDecimal(Model.TotalToll).ToString("N0")<span>đ</span></strong></span>
            <span class="d-block">Tổng phí khác: <strong class="text-danger">@Convert.ToDecimal(Model.TotalOther).ToString("N0")<span>đ</span></strong></span>
            <span class="d-block">Hóa đơn: <strong class="text-danger">@Convert.ToDecimal(Model.Bill).ToString("N0")<span>đ</span></strong></span>
            <span class="d-block">Tổng doanh số: <strong class="text-danger">@Convert.ToDecimal(Model.TotalSales).ToString("N0")<span>đ</span></strong></span>
            <span class="d-block">Tổng doanh thu: <strong class="text-danger">@Convert.ToDecimal(Model.TotalRevenue).ToString("N0")<span>đ</span></strong></span>
        </div>
        <div class="accordion-item border-left-slate">
            <div class="accordion-header">
                <div class="card-title">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-list"></i>
                    Danh sách chuyến chạy
                </div>
                <button type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#listArticle" aria-expanded="true">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-angle-down"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
            <div id="listArticle" class="accordion-collapse collapse show">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                    <p>Có tổng số <strong>@Model.Trips.TotalItemCount</strong> chuyến đi</p>
                    <table class="list_table tablecenter table-striped mb-4 table-tab">
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Tổng phí cầu đường</th>
                                <th>Tổng phí khác</th>
                                <th>Tổng doanh số</th>
                                <th>Hóa đơn</th>
                                <th>Tổng doanh thu</th>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>@Convert.ToDecimal(Model.TotalToll).ToString("N0")<span>đ</span></td>
                                <td>@Convert.ToDecimal(Model.TotalOther).ToString("N0")<span>đ</span></td>
                                <td>@Convert.ToDecimal(Model.TotalSales).ToString("N0")<span>đ</span></td>
                                <td class="bill-cell"
                                    data-bill="@Convert.ToDecimal(Model.Bill)">
                                    <span class="bill-value">@Convert.ToDecimal(Model.Bill).ToString("N0") đ</span>
                                </td>
                                <td class="total-td" data-total="@Convert.ToDecimal(Model.TotalRevenue)">@Convert.ToDecimal(Model.TotalRevenue).ToString("N0")<span>đ</span></td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                    <div class="table-responsive">
                        <table class="list_table tablecenter table-striped table-tab">
                            <tbody>
                                <tr>
                                    <th>Khách hàng</th>
                                    <th>Điểm đi</th>
                                    <th>Điểm đến</th>
                                    <th>Ngày đi</th>
                                    <th>Ngày về</th>
                                    <th>Lái xe</th>
                                    <th>Loại xe</th>
                                    <th>Nguồn</th>
                                    <th>Trạng thái</th>
                                    <th>Quãng đường</th>
                                    <th>Giá</th>
                                    <th>Cọc</th>
                                    <th>Giá khuyến mãi</th>
                                    <th>Phí cầu đường</th>
                                    <th>Phí khác</th>
                                    <th>Hóa đơn</th>
                                    <th>Ghi chú</th>
                                    <th style="width: 100px"></th>
                                </tr>
                                @foreach (var trip in Model.Trips)
                                {
                                    var bill = trip.Price * 0.04m;
                                    <tr data-id="@trip.Id">
                                        <td style="background:@trip.Status.ToColor()">
                                            <a href="javascript:;" class="text-white" data-src="@Url.Action("ListTripCustomer", new { customerId = trip.CustomerId })" data-fancybox data-type="ajax" data-touch="false">@trip.Customer.Code-@trip.Customer.Name</a>
                                        </td>
                                        <td>@trip.From</td>
                                        <td>@trip.To</td>
                                        <td>@Html.DisplayFor(a => trip.FromDate)</td>
                                        <td>@Html.DisplayFor(a => trip.ToDate)</td>
                                        <td>
                                            @if (trip.Driver.Name != null)
                                            {
                                                @trip.Driver.Name
                                            }
                                        </td>
                                        <td>@Html.DisplayFor(a => trip.TypeCar)</td>
                                        <td>@Html.DisplayFor(a => trip.Source)</td>
                                        <td>
                                            <select class="type-select" data-id="@trip.Id" style="width:100px">
                                                @foreach (StatusTrip type in Enum.GetValues(typeof(StatusTrip)))
                                                {
                                                    var text = ((Enum)type).GetDisplayName();
                                                    var selected = type == trip.Status ? "selected" : "";
                                                    <option value="@( (int)type )" @selected>@text</option>
                                                }
                                            </select>
                                        </td>
                                        <td>@trip.Distance km</td>
                                        <td>@Convert.ToDecimal(trip.Price).ToString("N0")</td>
                                        <td>@Convert.ToDecimal(trip.Pile).ToString("N0")</td>
                                        <td>@Convert.ToDecimal(trip.PriceSale).ToString("N0")</td>
                                        <td>@Convert.ToDecimal(trip.Tolls).ToString("N0")</td>
                                        <td>@Convert.ToDecimal(trip.Other).ToString("N0")</td>
                                        <td>
                                            @if (trip.Status != StatusTrip.Cancel)
                                            {
                                                <span class="show-bill " style="display:none">
                                                    @Convert.ToDecimal(bill).ToString("N0")
                                                </span>
                                                <label class="form-check-label">
                                                    <input type="checkbox" class="showbill-toggle" data-bill="@Convert.ToDecimal(bill)" data-id="@trip.Id" @if (trip.IsBillPaid) { @Html.Raw("value='true' checked")  } else { @Html.Raw("value='false'") } />
                                                    <span class="checkmark"></span>
                                                </label>
                                                @*<input type="checkbox" class="showbill-toggle" data-bill="@Convert.ToDecimal(bill)" data-id="@trip.Id" @(trip.IsBillPaid ? "checked" : "") />*@
                                            }
                                        </td>

                                        <td>@trip.Note</td>
                                        <td class="action-col">
                                            @Html.ActionLink("Sửa", "UpdateTrip", new { tripId = trip.Id }) -
                                            <a href="javascript:;" onclick="cloneTrip('@trip.Id')">Clone</a> -
                                            <a href="javascript:;" onclick="deleteTrip('@trip.Id')" style="color: red;">Xóa</a>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                }
                                @if (Model.Trips.PageCount > 1)
                                {
                                    <tr>
                                        <td colspan="14">@Html.PagedListPager(Model.Trips, page => Url.Action("ListTrip", new { page, code = Model.Code, mobile = Model.Mobile, driverId = Model.DriverId, customerId = Model.CustomerId, status = Model.Status, time = Model.Time, dateRange = Model.dateRange }))</td>
                                    </tr>
                                }
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>

                    <div class="my-accordion">
                        @foreach (var trip in Model.Trips)
                        {
                            var bill = trip.Price * 0.04m;
                            <div class="my-accordion-item" data-id="@trip.Id">
                                <div class="my-accordion-header">@trip.Customer.Name | @Convert.ToDecimal(trip.Price).ToString("N0") đ | @Html.DisplayFor(a => trip.Status)</div>
                                <div class="my-accordion-content">
                                    <p>Ngày đi:  <strong>@Html.DisplayFor(a => trip.FromDate)</strong> </p>
                                    <p>Ngày về: <strong>@Html.DisplayFor(a => trip.ToDate)</strong> </p>
                                    <p>Điểm đi: <strong>@trip.From</strong> </p>
                                    <p>Điểm đến: <strong>@trip.To</strong> </p>
                                    <p>
                                        Lái xe:
                                        <strong>
                                            @if (trip.Driver.Name != null)
                                            {
                                                @trip.Driver.Name
                                            }
                                        </strong>
                                    </p>
                                    <p>Loại xe: <strong>@Html.DisplayFor(a => trip.TypeCar)</strong> </p>
                                    <p>Quãng đường: <strong>@trip.Distance km</strong> </p>
                                    <p>Giá: <strong>@Convert.ToDecimal(trip.Price).ToString("N0") đ</strong> </p>
                                    <p>Cọc: <strong>@Convert.ToDecimal(trip.Pile).ToString("N0") đ</strong> </p>
                                    <p>Giá khuyến mãi: <strong>@Convert.ToDecimal(trip.PriceSale).ToString("N0") đ</strong> </p>
                                    <p>Phí cầu đường: <strong>@Convert.ToDecimal(trip.Tolls).ToString("N0") đ</strong> </p>
                                    <p>Phí khác: <strong>@Convert.ToDecimal(trip.Other).ToString("N0") đ</strong> </p>
                                    <p>
                                        Trạng thái  <select class="type-select mb-2" data-id="@trip.Id" style="width:100px">
                                            @foreach (StatusTrip type in Enum.GetValues(typeof(StatusTrip)))
                                            {
                                                var text = ((Enum)type).GetDisplayName();
                                                var selected = type == trip.Status ? "selected" : "";
                                                <option value="@( (int)type )" @selected>@text</option>
                                            }
                                        </select>
                                    </p>
                                    @if (trip.IsBillPaid)
                                    {
                                        <p>Hóa đơn: <span class="d-block"> <strong>@Convert.ToDecimal(bill).ToString("N0")</strong></span> đ</p>
                                    }
                                    <p>Note:  <span class="d-block">@trip.Note</span> </p>
                                    <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                                        <div class="edit"><a href="@Url.Action("UpdateTrip", new { tripId = trip.Id })"><i class="fas fa-edit"></i></a></div>
                                        <div class="delete" onclick="cloneTrip('@trip.Id')"><i class="fa-regular fa-clone"></i></div>
                                        <div class="delete" onclick="deleteTrip('@trip.Id')"><i class="fas fa-trash-alt"></i></div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        }
                        @if (Model.Trips.PageCount > 1)
                        {
                            @Html.PagedListPager(Model.Trips, page => Url.Action("ListTrip", new { page, code = Model.Code, mobile = Model.Mobile, driverId = Model.DriverId, customerId = Model.CustomerId, status = Model.Status, time = Model.Time, dateRange = Model.dateRange }))
                        }
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

@section scripts
{
    <script src="~/Scripts/select2.js"></script>
    <script src="~/Scripts/moment.min.js"></script>
    <script src="~/Scripts/daterangepicker.js"></script>
    <script type="text/javascript">
        function parseCurrency(str) {
            return parseInt(str.replace(/[^\d]/g, '')) || 0;
        }
        function formatCurrency(num) {
            return num.toLocaleString('vi-VN') + " đ";
        }
        var totalBill = 0;
        var totalVat = 0;

        function updateSummary() {
            $("#total-bill").text(formatCurrency(totalBill));
            $("#total-vat").text(formatCurrency(totalVat));
        }
        $('.showbill-toggle').each(function () {
            var isChecked = $(this).is(':checked');
            var billSpan = $(this).closest('td').find('.show-bill');
            billSpan.toggle(isChecked);
        });

        $(document).on('change', '.showbill-toggle', function () {
            var totalValue = $(".total-td").data("total");
            var total = $(".total-td");
            var isChecked = $(this).is(':checked');
            var $row = $(this).closest('tr');

            var billSpan = $(this).closest('td').find('.show-bill');
            billSpan.toggle(isChecked);

            var $billSpan = $('.bill-value');
            var $vatSpan = $('.vat-value');
            var currentValue = parseCurrency($billSpan.text());
            var currentTotal = parseCurrency(total.text());
            var inputValue = parseInt($(this).data('bill')) || 0;

            console.log(currentTotal)
            var newValue = currentValue;
            var newTotal = currentTotal;
            if (isChecked) {
                newValue = currentValue + inputValue;
                newTotal = totalValue - newValue
            } else {
                newValue = currentValue - inputValue;
                if (newValue < 0) newValue = 0;
                newTotal = totalValue + newValue
            }

            console.log(currentTotal)

            $billSpan.text(formatCurrency(newValue));
            total.text(formatCurrency(currentTotal));


            var tripId = $(this).data('id');

            $.ajax({
                url: '/mms/cap-nhat-nhanh',
                type: 'POST',
                data: { id: tripId, showbill: isChecked },
                success: function (res) {
                    if (res) {
                        $.toast({
                            text: "Cập nhật thành công",
                            position: 'bottom-right',
                            icon: 'success',
                        })
                    } else {
                        alert("❌ " + res.message);
                    }
                },
                error: function (xhr, status, error) {
                    console.error("Ajax Error:", status, error);
                    alert("⚠️ Lỗi kết nối tới server!");
                }
            });
        });

        $('.select2').select2();
        $('.datepicker').daterangepicker({
            autoUpdateInput: false,
            autoApply: true,
            showDropdowns: true,
            minYear: 2022,
            maxYear: parseInt(moment().format('YYYY'), 10) + 5,
            locale: {
                format: 'DD/MM/YYYY'
            }
        }).on("apply.daterangepicker", function (e, picker) {
            picker.element.val(picker.startDate.format(picker.locale.format) + ' - ' + picker.endDate.format(picker.locale.format));
        });
        $(document).on('change', '.type-select', function () {
            var id = $(this).data('id');
            var type = $(this).val();

            $.ajax({
                url: '@Url.Action("UpdateTypeTrip", "Customer")',
                type: 'POST',
                data: { id: id, type: type },
                success: function (res) {
                    if (res.success) {
                        $.toast({
                            text: "Cập nhật thành công",
                            position: 'bottom-right',
                            icon: 'success',
                        })
                    } else {
                        alert('❌ ' + res.message);
                    }
                }
            });
        });
        function deleteTrip(id) {
            if (confirm("Bạn có chắc chắn xóa chuyến đi này không?")) {
                $.post("/Customer/DeleteTrip", { tripId: id }, function (data) {
                    if (data) {
                        $.toast({
                            text: 'Xóa chuyến đi thành công',
                            position: 'bottom-right',
                            icon: 'success',
                        })
                        $("tr[data-id='" + id + "']").fadeOut();
                        $("div[data-id='" + id + "']").fadeOut();
                    }
                    else {
                        $.toast({
                            text: 'Quá trình thực hiện không thành công. Hãy thử lại',
                            icon: 'error',
                        })
                    }
                });
            }
        }
        function cloneTrip(id) {
            $.ajax({
                url: '/mms/clone-trip',
                type: 'POST',
                data: { id: id },
                success: function (res) {
                    if (res.status) {
                        $.toast({
                            text: res.msg,
                            position: 'bottom-right',
                            icon: 'success',
                        })
                    } else {
                        alert("❌ " + res.msg);
                    }
                },
                error: function (xhr, status, err) {
                    alert("Lỗi Ajax: " + err);
                }
            });
        }
    </script>
}


